    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82211" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισταλτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστέλλὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clasping and compressing</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις π</span>. the
			<i>peristaltic</i> action of the bowels, by which their contents
			are propelled, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i> ; also of the bladder, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.404
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. ἐνέργεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
					3.8
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>UP</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
					3.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
